Cell["\<\
A reflection is not a cyclic symmetry. Under cyclic symmetry an edge together \
with its reversal is two different edges, while an edge together with its \
rotation is the same edge twice:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->963865444,ExpressionUUID->"dc81dcfe-a01f-1d4d-91c1-3085cf13fc01"],

